      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Behold! The Dwarven Mines."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Look at yon canal. Dwarves built it to transport mined metals deeper into Knalga. And d’ye ken those two rooms, one to the north-west and the other to the south-east? If we could capture those, we would gain o’ great tactical advantage."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Grim gods of darkness! The whole place is swarming with undead! They have raised corpses to do their work."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("And they seem to have good security, too. Look, most of the fortifications are repaired and they have those nasty skeletons everywhere."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Fortunately, this entrance seems to be in disrepair. It doesn’t look like they have noticed us yet."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thorin",
            text: _("WHO GOES THERE?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("(<i>Wince</i>)."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Oops, I spoke too soon."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("Maybe he needs a fireball..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thorin",
            text: _("YOU DO NOT ANSWER. ALERT THE MASTER!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_unit_hidden",
            id: "Malifor",
            hidden: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("Who goes there? Ahhh, more slaves, I see."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Others have made that mistake before. Who are you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("Who am I? (<i>Cackles wildly</i>) I am Malifor the Great, the master of death! These tunnels, haunted by the ghosts of the dead dwarves of Knalga, are the domain of my power."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("You dared disturb the rest of those brave dwarves? You shall pay in blood!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("HAHAHAHA! Your petty temper tantrums are most amusing, you puny dwarf. Soon I will finish the slaughter that the orcs have begun so promisingly, and Knalga will be all mine! From there I will sweep the whole north of all living creatures, and then swoop down upon Wesnoth!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Quit your ranting, you wretched bag of bones! Prepare to return to the dust!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("HAHAHAHA! Such vast threats from one so small? HAHAHA!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("But– My my, what do we have here? — Tallin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("He knows your name, Tallin. I don’t like the sound of this."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("Oh yes, I know you, Tallin. I have been watching you for a long time. You are a perfect candidate to become one of my immortal generals."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("...!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("Look around you, Tallin; see all the power, see all of the wealth, the glory, the pleasure that the realm of death has to offer. Think of the great empire of Knalga; it can be yours. Come, share it with me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Tallin! Get hold of yourself!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("It’s very easy, Tallin... See that little vermin by your side? Take out your knife... cut his throat... feel his hot blood pump over your hands... sacrifice him!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("(<i>Shakes head</i>) I reject your evil. Attack, men! Let us rid the good green world of this rotting filth!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Aye! That’s the way of it, lad! For the murdered dwarves of Knalga! Attack!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("You fool! You will pay for your folly with your life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Yeah, right, buddy."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("These little vermin are making progress! This is unacceptable. Rise, my minions — gorge on the flesh of these scurrying little rats!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Ss",
            cells: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Look out everyone, something is coming out of the canals! Already the water is churning and clogging with their filth. Get back and brace yourselves."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
