          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("<i>Fooood</i>!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("Lords of Light, what kind of vile creation are those things!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Malifor%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malifor",
            text: _("HAHAHA, you puny weaklings think you can destroy me? <i>Fools</i>! You will all soon be serving me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "magic-dark-big-miss.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Malifor",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 35,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Oh no, he just... disappeared."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("We have finally secured the mines. But what should we do about that foul lich? He is a menace to all that lives, and must be ended."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Aye! We’ll have to lay both his skeletons and himself to final rest before these caves will be fit for dwarvenkind again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("But I’m sore vexed. We need better weapons. Luck and spirit can carry us only so far."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("Aye. We must do both. I’m thinking it might be best if I muster my folk to start on the weapon-making while you and your followers pursue yon lich. By the time you’ve laid him to final rest and return here, we’ll ha’ made a good start on the work."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("So it shall be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "follower",
            text: _("With all respect, Lord Hamel, some o’ us would like to fare forth with Tallin. He’s lucky, he is — or he makes his own luck."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Hamel",
            text: _("And so it shall be. You’ve my leave and welcome. Try to keep the lad safe..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "follower",
            text: _("Thank you, Lord Hamel."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Hamel",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "disallow",
            types: "Dwarvish Fighter,Dwarvish Thunderer,Dwarvish Scout,Dwarvish Guardsman",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Tallin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("Argh! I am finished, but our campaign must... not end... crush... our... enemies... and... save... our... people..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Supporter",
            text: _("No, Tallin, we can’t do it without you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Camerin%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Camerin",
            text: _("What... how can this happen?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Tallin",
            text: _("He was stark raving mad, but I am sure going to miss him."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
